  "sourceConclusions": [
    "The existing override loop was extracted into run_owned_overrides, called by run_negatives and the focused development driver.",
    "WarningsAsErrors is cleared only on the two intentionally incompatible restore/build fixtures; TreatWarningsAsErrors=false and the suppressed fixture NoWarn setting remain local to those fixtures.",
    "The visible fixture requires an actually printed warning NU1605 or NU1608; a bare diagnostic identifier or unrelated build failure does not satisfy this witness.",
    "Both builds still require nonzero exit and the shipped NWPKG001 diagnostic. Shipping PackageClosure.cs and compatibility.py hashes are unchanged.",
    "The focused driver invokes real dotnet subprocesses with separate caches and checks resolved previous Database version; only the development adapter replaces public NuGet with already cached local external archives and disables audit for this offline preflight."
  ],
